      339.68,
      547.18,
      361.76
    ],
    "text": "Claimant: Seylan Business (Pvt) Ltd of No. 10/18 Lake Drive,Colombo 08; Extent: 3.4560 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      375.68,
      547.22,
      433.76
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorised in writing, beforeme at 10.00 a.m. on the 15th February, 2019 at Mannar TownDivisional Secretariat.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      447.68,
      547.41,
      517.76
    ],
    "text": "And further you are hereby requested to notify to me inwriting (in duplicate) on or before the 08th February, 2019 thenature of their interest in the land, the particulars of theirclaims for the compensation for the acquisition of the saidland/servitude, the mount of compensation and the details ofthe computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
